Provenance of the task data
---------------------------
The LRAB task texts, prompts, and fixtures are **author-written synthetic
content**. They were written for this benchmark and are published here in
full. Any organisation names, DOIs, citations, or other identifiers appearing
in them are synthetic placeholders created for the tasks; they are not
third-party material and do not reproduce any real web page, article body, or
other third-party document. The web-research tasks are executed by the harness
at run time against live search, but no fetched third-party page content is
stored in this repository.

Third-party benchmarks
----------------------
The `benchmarks/tau2/*.json` files are **derived indexes only** — one row per
(task id, harness) recording the outcome of running a harness on that task
(`status`, `reward`, `wall`). They are keyed by upstream task id. No upstream
τ²-bench task text, user-simulator script, tool schema, or domain database is
redistributed here; obtaining and running τ²-bench is left to the reader. See
`THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES` for the upstream project and where to get it.

Nothing in this repository is a redistribution of any other third-party
benchmark's task set or answer set.
